  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Activity of a radioactive material is given by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup></math>, here,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi></math>- is decay constant.</p><p>Taking logarithmic function both sides,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p>Using relation between half life and decay constant,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></msub></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>16</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></msub></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>ln</mi><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>30</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>yrs</mi></math></p></blockquote>",
